      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ahmad Bin Muhammad Bin Isa, from Muhammad Bin Khalid, and Al Husayn Bin Saeed, from Al Qasim Bin Urwat, from Abdullah Bin Bukeyr, from Zurara, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> regarding the Words of Allah<sup>azwj</sup> Blessed and High <span class=\"ibTxt\"><a href=\"/#/books/quran:24#h31\"><a href=\"/books/quran:24#h31\">[24:31]</a></a> except what appears thereof</span>. He<sup>asws</sup> said: The apparent adornment, the kohl and the ring’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "3. Ahmad ibn Muhammad ibn ‘Isa has narrated from Muhammad ibn Khalid and al-Husayn ibn Sa‘id from al-Qasim ibn al-‘Urwah from ‘Abd Allah ibn Bukayr from Zurarah who has said the following: “About the words of Allah, most Blessed, most High, ’. . . except what is exposed,’ abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, said, ‘The exposed beauty is kohl and rings.’” "
        ]
      }
